### Créer un client
POST http://localhost:8080/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Client Test"
}

### Lister tous les clients
GET http://localhost:8080/clients

### Créer un decodeur pour le client 1
POST http://localhost:8080/decodeurs/client/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Decodeur Salon",
  "adresseIp": "127.0.10.1"
}

### Voir tous les decodeurs
GET http://localhost:8080/decodeurs

### Lister les decodeurs du client 1
GET http://localhost:8080/decodeurs/client/1

### Etat du decodeur 1
GET http://localhost:8080/decodeurs/1/etat

### Redemarrer decodeur 1
POST http://localhost:8080/decodeurs/1/reset

### Ajouter chaine
POST http://localhost:8080/decodeurs/1/chaines?chaine=TVA

### Supprimer decodeur
DELETE http://localhost:8080/decodeurs/1

### Supprimer client
DELETE http://localhost:8080/clients/1

### Créer compte admin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Administrateur",
  "courriel": "admin@cable.com",
  "motDePasse": "admin123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}